  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation interface, separating sensor outcomes from motion commands. The specification encodes safe, progress-oriented exploration: move forward or random_walk when clear, recover with directed turns or brief backward motion only when needed, and return to exploration as soon as safe. All obstacle events force a recovery state with a single safe action. After move_backward, a turn is required before resuming exploration. full_rotate is only allowed as a last-resort scan after repeated blockage.",
